#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello alderatzen dituen zure aurpegiaren argazkiak. Gutxienez bi "
"gorde, argiztapen ezberdinetan grabatuta."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Honetarako gordetako ereduak erakusten:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Aurpegi-eredu bakarra dago matrikulatuta. Argiak zure aurpegia kameraren "
"itxura aldatzen du; beraz, modelo bakar batek huts egin dezake arratsaldean "
"lanpararen azpian (edo egun argian). Gehitu argi ezberdinetan grabatutako "
"bigarren modelo bat desblokeatzea fidagarria izateko eguneko edozein unetan."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Gehitu bigarren eredu bat"

